<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>CV - Naim</title>
<meta name="description" content="CV Naim, Software Engineer PPL Angkatan 5">
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#050507; --bg2:#14141c; --red:#ff003c; --blue:#00e5ff; --text:#e6e6ec; --muted:#9a9aa8; --card:rgba(18,18,26,.88);
  box-sizing:border-box;
  padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px); padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px);
}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:inherit}
html{scroll-padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px)}
body{
  margin:0; min-height:100vh; color:var(--text); line-height:1.65;
  font-family:'Segoe UI',Tahoma,Geneva,Verdana,sans-serif;
  background:radial-gradient(ellipse at top,#262634 0%,var(--bg2) 35%,var(--bg) 100%) fixed;
  overflow-x:hidden;
}
/* jaring laba-laba di latar */
.web-bg{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:0;opacity:.18;pointer-events:none}
.web-bg svg{width:100%;height:100%}

/* Spider-Man 2D bergelantungan */
.swing{position:fixed;top:0;left:50%;z-index:1;width:0;height:0;pointer-events:none;animation:swing 4.5s ease-in-out infinite;transform-origin:50% 0}
.swing .line{position:absolute;left:-1px;top:0;width:2px;height:150px;background:linear-gradient(#fff,#cfd8dc);box-shadow:0 0 6px #fff;animation:len 4.5s ease-in-out infinite}
.swing svg{position:absolute;left:-45px;top:140px;width:90px;height:auto;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 10px rgba(255,0,60,.6))}
@keyframes swing{0%,100%{transform:rotate(-24deg)}50%{transform:rotate(24deg)}}
@keyframes len{0%,100%{height:150px}50%{height:170px}}
@media(max-width:700px){.swing{left:88%}.swing .line{height:90px}.swing svg{width:60px;left:-30px;top:84px}}

/* gedung 2D parallax di bawah */
.city{position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;height:140px;z-index:0;pointer-events:none;opacity:.5}
.city svg{position:absolute;bottom:0;width:200%;height:100%;animation:slide 40s linear infinite}
.city .far{opacity:.5;animation-duration:70s}
@keyframes slide{to{transform:translateX(-50%)}}

.cv{
  position:relative;z-index:2;max-width:820px;margin:40px auto;padding:44px;
  background:var(--card);border-radius:14px;backdrop-filter:blur(6px);
  border-top:4px solid var(--red);border-bottom:4px solid var(--blue);
  box-shadow:0 18px 45px rgba(255,0,60,.18),0 0 40px rgba(0,229,255,.08);
}
header{text-align:center;padding-bottom:26px;border-bottom:1px solid #2c2c3a;margin-bottom:10px}
h1{margin:0;font-size:3em;letter-spacing:3px;color:var(--red);text-shadow:0 0 18px rgba(255,0,60,.55),2px 2px 4px #000;animation:glitch 6s infinite}
@keyframes glitch{0%,92%,100%{transform:none}94%{transform:translate(-3px,1px);text-shadow:3px 0 var(--blue),-3px 0 var(--red)}96%{transform:translate(3px,-1px)}}
.role{margin:6px 0 2px;color:var(--blue);font-size:1.2em;font-weight:400}
.loc{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.92em}

h2{
  margin:36px 0 14px;padding-left:14px;font-size:1.1em;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--blue);border-left:4px solid var(--red);
}
p{margin:0}
.skills{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0}
.skills li{
  padding:8px 16px;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid #333;
  background:linear-gradient(145deg,#23232f,#101016);transition:.25s;
}
.skills li:hover{border-color:var(--red);box-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(255,0,60,.5);transform:translateY(-3px)}
.project{background:#101016;padding:20px;border-radius:8px;border-left:3px solid var(--blue);transition:.25s}
.project:hover{border-left-color:var(--red);box-shadow:0 0 18px rgba(0,229,255,.2)}
.project h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:1.1em}
.project p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.95em}
.hobbies{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px}
.hobbies span{padding:10px 16px;background:#16161e;border:1px solid #333;border-radius:6px;font-size:.92em}
.hobbies .g{color:#4caf50}.hobbies .y{color:#ffb300}
footer{margin-top:34px;text-align:center;color:#666;font-size:.8em}

@media(max-width:600px){.cv{margin:20px 12px;padding:26px 20px}h1{font-size:2.2em}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="web-bg" aria-hidden="true">
<svg viewBox="0 0 800 800" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMin slice" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1">
  <g transform="translate(400,0)">
    <path d="M0 0L-500 800M0 0L-300 800M0 0L-120 800M0 0L120 800M0 0L300 800M0 0L500 800M0 0L-800 500M0 0L800 500"/>
    <path d="M-80 160Q0 190 80 160M-170 340Q0 380 170 340M-270 540Q0 590 270 540M-370 740Q0 800 370 740"/>
  </g>
</svg>
</div>

<!-- Spider-Man berayun -->
<div class="swing" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="line"></div>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 90 120" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
    <!-- kaki -->
    <path d="M30 78L18 112L30 114L42 86Z" fill="#1b4bd1"/>
    <path d="M60 78L74 108L62 112L48 86Z" fill="#d6002f"/>
    <!-- badan -->
    <path d="M28 40Q45 32 62 40L66 82Q45 92 24 82Z" fill="#d6002f"/>
    <path d="M45 36V88M32 52Q45 58 58 52M30 68Q45 74 60 68" stroke="#6b0017" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none"/>
    <path d="M45 52L38 70L52 70Z" fill="#111"/>
    <!-- lengan memegang tali -->
    <path d="M30 44L22 20L30 14L36 40Z" fill="#d6002f"/>
    <path d="M60 44L68 62L58 68L52 48Z" fill="#1b4bd1"/>
    <circle cx="28" cy="10" r="5" fill="#fff"/>
    <!-- kepala -->
    <ellipse cx="45" cy="24" rx="15" ry="17" fill="#d6002f"/>
    <path d="M45 8V40M33 14Q45 22 57 14M30 26H60M33 36Q45 30 57 36" stroke="#6b0017" stroke-width="1" fill="none"/>
    <path d="M31 22Q36 16 43 24Q38 31 31 22ZM59 22Q54 16 47 24Q52 31 59 22Z" fill="#fff" stroke="#111" stroke-width="2"/>
  </svg>
</div>

<!-- Gedung kota 2D bergerak -->
<div class="city" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg class="far" viewBox="0 0 1200 140" preserveAspectRatio="none">
    <path fill="#161622" d="M0 140V70h60V40h50v50h60V50h40v90h70V60h50V30h60v80h70V70h60v70h80V45h50v95h70V65h60v75h90V55h60V90h70v50H600V70h60v70h80V50h50v90H0Z"/>
  </svg>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 1200 140" preserveAspectRatio="none">
    <path fill="#0b0b12" d="M0 140V95h50V60h40v35h60V75h50v65h60V80h40V50h50v90h70V85h60v55h80V70h40v70h70V90h60V60h50v80h60V100h70v40Z"/>
    <g fill="#ffd54f" opacity=".7"><rect x="62" y="70" width="6" height="6"/><rect x="182" y="90" width="6" height="6"/><rect x="332" y="60" width="6" height="6"/><rect x="520" y="95" width="6" height="6"/><rect x="760" y="80" width="6" height="6"/><rect x="940" y="72" width="6" height="6"/></g>
  </svg>
</div>

<main class="cv">
  <header>
    <h1>Naim</h1>
    <h2 class="role" style="all:unset;display:block;color:var(--blue);font-size:1.2em;margin:6px 0 2px">Software Engineer (PPL Angkatan 5)</h2>
    <p class="loc">Jombang, Jawa Timur</p>
  </header>

  <section>
    <h2>Profil Singkat</h2>
    <p>Pengembang perangkat lunak dengan pendekatan alur kerja modular yang terstruktur, mulai dari perancangan arsitektur dan pemodelan basis data sebelum masuk ke fase implementasi kode. Di luar aktivitas perancangan web, saya gemar mengeksplorasi hutan untuk menyegarkan pikiran. Ketelitian, fokus, dan taktik penyelesaian masalah saya sering terinspirasi oleh efisiensi gerak dalam film favorit saya, <strong>John Wick</strong>.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Keterampilan Teknis</h2>
    <ul class="skills">
      <li>Python &amp; Flask</li>
      <li>HTML, CSS &amp; Bootstrap 5</li>
      <li>JavaScript &amp; Node.js</li>
      <li>SQLite</li>
      <li>SDLC &amp; Pemodelan UML</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Pengalaman Proyek</h2>
    <div class="project">
      <h3>Library Management System</h3>
      <p>Aplikasi berbasis web menggunakan Flask dan SQLite. Mengimplementasikan sistem autentikasi, Role-Based Access Control (RBAC), alur peminjaman, serta antarmuka dengan skema warna yang dinamis.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Minat &amp; Hobi</h2>
    <div class="hobbies">
      <span class="g">🌲 Eksplorasi Hutan</span>
      <span class="y">🎬 Film Aksi (John Wick)</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>© Naim</footer>
</main>

</body>
</html>
